that they are placed

cue0144763
01:06:37.600 --> 01:06:38.600
by this same order

cue0144764
01:06:38.600 --> 01:06:39.600
in your body,

cue0144765
01:06:39.600 --> 01:06:41.600
in mine,

cue0144766
01:06:41.600 --> 01:06:43.600
in all circumstances,

cue0144767
01:06:43.600 --> 01:06:44.600
in all men.

cue0144768
01:06:44.600 --> 01:06:45.600
Everything is organized

cue0144769
01:06:45.600 --> 01:06:46.600
the same way.

cue0144770
01:06:46.600 --> 01:06:47.600
He says,

cue0144771
01:06:47.600 --> 01:06:48.600
of course.

cue0144772
01:06:48.600 --> 01:06:49.600
He says,

cue0144773
01:06:49.600 --> 01:06:50.600
have you ever saw

cue0144774
01:06:50.600 --> 01:06:51.600
that somebody has the brain

cue0144775
01:06:51.600 --> 01:06:52.600
in the chest,

cue0144776
01:06:52.600 --> 01:06:53.600
the liver in the head,

cue0144777
01:06:53.600 --> 01:06:54.600
the heart in the stomach?

cue0144778
01:06:54.600 --> 01:06:55.600
No,

cue0144779
01:06:55.600 --> 01:06:56.600
there is no such thing.

cue0144780
01:06:56.600 --> 01:06:57.600
Everything is in order.

cue0144781
01:06:57.600 --> 01:06:58.600
And now he says,

cue0144782
01:06:58.600 --> 01:06:59.600
if the Earth,

cue0144783
01:06:59.600 --> 01:07:01.600
inhabited by us,

cue0144784
01:07:01.600 --> 01:07:02.600
is a star,

cue0144785
01:07:02.600 --> 01:07:03.600
and it has seas,

cue0144786
01:07:03.600 --> 01:07:04.600
rivers,

cue0144787
01:07:04.600 --> 01:07:05.600
mountains,

cue0144788
01:07:05.600 --> 01:07:06.600
valleys,

cue0144789
01:07:06.600 --> 01:07:07.600
animals,

cue0144790
01:07:07.600 --> 01:07:08.600
rationales and irrationales,

cue0144791
01:07:08.600 --> 01:07:09.600
seasons of years,

cue0144792
01:07:09.600 --> 01:07:10.600
why won't there be

cue0144793
01:07:10.600 --> 01:07:11.600
the same

cue0144794
01:07:11.600 --> 01:07:14.600
on the other planets,

cue0144795
01:07:14.600 --> 01:07:15.600
he says,

cue0144796
01:07:15.600 --> 01:07:24.600
[inaudible]

cue0144797
01:07:24.600 --> 01:07:26.600
Why shouldn't there be?

cue0144798
01:07:26.600 --> 01:07:27.600
And he goes to elaborate

cue0144799
01:07:27.600 --> 01:07:28.600
and elaborate

cue0144800
01:07:28.600 --> 01:07:29.600
and elaborate

cue0144801
01:07:29.600 --> 01:07:31.600
and elaborate.

cue0144802
01:07:31.600 --> 01:07:33.600
A summary.

cue0144803
01:07:33.600 --> 01:07:34.600
All right?

cue0144804
01:07:34.600 --> 01:07:36.600
Rabbi David Neto,

cue0144805
01:07:36.600 --> 01:07:37.600
he belonged

cue0144806
01:07:37.600 --> 01:07:39.600
to a special tradition.

cue0144807
01:07:39.600 --> 01:07:40.600
I call it

cue0144808
01:07:40.600 --> 01:07:43.600
Jewish religious humanism.

cue0144809
01:07:44.600 --> 01:07:47.600
This tradition believed

cue0144810
01:07:47.600 --> 01:07:48.600
that since everything

cue0144811
01:07:48.600 --> 01:07:50.600
is created by God,

cue0144812
01:07:50.600 --> 01:07:53.600
including human intelligence,

cue0144813
01:07:53.600 --> 01:07:54.600
human knowledge,

cue0144814
01:07:54.600 --> 01:07:55.600
human science,

cue0144815
01:07:55.600 --> 01:07:56.600
there cannot be

cue0144816
01:07:56.600 --> 01:07:59.600
any contradiction

cue0144817
01:07:59.600 --> 01:08:03.600
between science

cue0144818
01:08:03.600 --> 01:08:05.600
and the Tora.

cue0144819
01:08:05.600 --> 01:08:06.600
That science and the Tora

cue0144820
01:08:06.600 --> 01:08:09.600
complement each other.

cue0144821
01:08:09.600 --> 01:08:10.600
Science

cue0144822
01:08:10.600 --> 01:08:13.600
makes us understand the Tora.

cue0144823
01:08:13.600 --> 01:08:14.600
The Tora

cue0144824
01:08:14.600 --> 01:08:17.600
makes us understand science.

cue0144825
01:08:17.600 --> 01:08:18.600
And therefore,

cue0144826
01:08:18.600 --> 01:08:19.600
to be Jewish,

cue0144827
01:08:19.600 --> 01:08:21.600
you don't need

cue0144828
01:08:21.600 --> 01:08:23.600
to erect any kind of

cue0144829
01:08:23.600 --> 01:08:26.600
psychological walls

cue0144830
01:08:26.600 --> 01:08:28.600
to divide between you

cue0144831
01:08:28.600 --> 01:08:30.600
and the rest of the world

cue0144832
01:08:30.600 --> 01:08:32.600
and the country.

cue0144833
01:08:32.600 --> 01:08:34.600
If we believe in our Tora,

cue0144834
01:08:34.600 --> 01:08:35.600
if we believe

cue0144835
01:08:35.600 --> 01:08:37.600
that our Tora comes from God,

cue0144836
01:08:37.600 --> 01:08:38.600
and if we believe

cue0144837
01:08:38.600 --> 01:08:39.600
that the same God

cue0144838
01:08:39.600 --> 01:08:40.600
in the Tora

cue0144839
01:08:40.600 --> 01:08:41.600
is the author

cue0144840
01:08:41.600 --> 01:08:42.600
not only of the laws

cue0144841
01:08:42.600 --> 01:08:43.600
of the miṣva,

cue0144842
01:08:43.600 --> 01:08:44.600
but of the physical laws

cue0144843
01:08:44.600 --> 01:08:46.600
controlling the universe,

cue0144844
01:08:46.600 --> 01:08:50.600
why should we be afraid

cue0144845
01:08:50.600 --> 01:08:51.600
and think

cue0144846
01:08:51.600 --> 01:08:53.600
that if we study science,

cue0144847
01:08:53.600 --> 01:08:56.600
science is going to contradict the Tora?

cue0144848
01:08:56.600 --> 01:08:58.600
This fear

cue0144849
01:08:58.600 --> 01:09:00.600
is based

cue0144850
01:09:00.600 --> 01:09:03.600
in a lack of confidence

cue0144851
01:09:03.600 --> 01:09:05.600
in the great wisdom

cue0144852
01:09:05.600 --> 01:09:06.600
of the Tora.

cue0144853
01:09:06.600 --> 01:09:08.600
Not only that Judaism

cue0144854
01:09:08.600 --> 01:09:11.600
is not against science,

cue0144855
01:09:11.600 --> 01:09:12.600
moreover,

cue0144856
01:09:12.600 --> 01:09:15.600
Judaism is in favor

cue0144857
01:09:15.600 --> 01:09:16.600
of science.

cue0144858
01:09:16.600 --> 01:09:21.600
The hachavim say something very profound.

cue0144859
01:09:21.600 --> 01:09:23.600
Tora bat goyim,

cue0144860
01:09:23.600 --> 01:09:25.600
al ta'min.

cue0144861
01:09:25.600 --> 01:09:27.600
If they tell you there is religion

cue0144862
01:09:27.600 --> 01:09:29.600
minashamayim

cue0144863
01:09:29.600 --> 01:09:30.600
among the goyim,

cue0144864
01:09:30.600 --> 01:09:31.600
don't believe.

cue0144865
01:09:31.600 --> 01:09:34.600
Ḥokhma bat goyim,

cue0144866
01:09:34.600 --> 01:09:35.600
ta'min.

cue0144867
01:09:35.600 --> 01:09:36.600
Science,

cue0144868
01:09:36.600 --> 01:09:37.600
science,

cue0144869
01:09:37.600 --> 01:09:38.600
there is.

cue0144870
01:09:38.600 --> 01:09:39.600
And there are rabbis

cue0144871
01:09:39.600 --> 01:09:40.600
who are more liberal

cue0144872
01:09:40.600 --> 01:09:43.600
than what we can ever imagine.

cue0144873
01:09:43.600 --> 01:09:44.600
It says that when we see

cue0144874
01:09:44.600 --> 01:09:47.600
Ḥakham mechachme'umot ha'olam,

cue0144875
01:09:47.600 --> 01:09:50.600
when we see a great

cue0144876
01:09:50.600 --> 01:09:51.600
wise man of wisdom

cue0144877
01:09:51.600 --> 01:09:53.600
among the gentiles,

cue0144878
01:09:53.600 --> 01:09:55.600
we must say a berachah.

cue0144879
01:09:55.600 --> 01:09:56.600
Baruch atah Hashem,

cue0144880
01:09:56.600 --> 01:09:57.600
melokinu mechachme'umot ha'olam,

cue0144881
01:09:57.600 --> 01:10:00.600
hanoten mechokhmato lebasav ha'olam.

cue0144882
01:10:00.600 --> 01:10:04.600
That he shared his wisdom

cue0144883
01:10:04.600 --> 01:10:05.600
with a human.

cue0144884
01:10:05.600 --> 01:10:07.600
Just about a week ago,

cue0144885
01:10:07.600 --> 01:10:10.600
I bought a book about Einstein.

cue0144886
01:10:10.600 --> 01:10:14.600
Written by Abraham Pais,

cue0144887
01:10:14.600 --> 01:10:15.600
a Jew.

cue0144888
01:10:15.600 --> 01:10:17.600
I think he must be a Dutch Jew

cue0144889
01:10:17.600 --> 01:10:18.600
because he knows German very well.

cue0144890
01:10:18.600 --> 01:10:19.600
And the name Pais

cue0144891
01:10:19.600 --> 01:10:20.600
obviously is a Spanish name

cue0144892
01:10:20.600 --> 01:10:23.600
so I believe he probably is a Dutch Jew.

cue0144893
01:10:23.600 --> 01:10:26.600
In the first page,

cue0144894
01:10:26.600 --> 01:10:29.600
he gives us two quotations

cue0144895
01:10:29.600 --> 01:10:30.600
from Einstein.

cue0144896
01:10:30.600 --> 01:10:32.600
I don't remember the second one

cue0144897
01:10:32.600 --> 01:10:33.600
but I remember the first one.

cue0144898
01:10:33.600 --> 01:10:34.600
The first one says,

cue0144899
01:10:34.600 --> 01:10:37.600
Einstein says,

cue0144900
01:10:37.600 --> 01:10:41.600
Science without religion is lame.

cue0144901
01:10:41.600 --> 01:10:42.600
Lame in the sense,

cue0144902
01:10:42.600 --> 01:10:43.600
it cannot walk.

cue0144903
01:10:43.600 --> 01:10:47.600
It means that it cannot explain.

cue0144904
01:10:47.600 --> 01:10:52.600
Religion without science is blind.

cue0144905
01:10:52.600 --> 01:10:55.600
This is exactly what the Jews believe in.

cue0144906
01:10:55.600 --> 01:10:58.600
And the rabbinic tradition,

cue0144907
01:10:58.600 --> 01:11:02.600
maligned by everyone,

cue0144908
01:11:02.600 --> 01:11:04.600
especially the Christians.

cue0144909
01:11:04.600 --> 01:11:05.600
Unfortunately,

cue0144910
01:11:05.600 --> 01:11:08.600
liberal Jews who never had the opportunity

cue0144911
01:11:08.600 --> 01:11:11.600
to study Tora well,

cue0144912
01:11:11.600 --> 01:11:14.600
they were the forerunners

cue0144913
01:11:14.600 --> 01:11:17.600
of scientific thought.

cue0144914
01:11:17.600 --> 01:11:20.600
In the fifth chapter of this book,

cue0144915
01:11:20.600 --> 01:11:22.600
Rabbi David Nieto

cue0144916
01:11:22.600 --> 01:11:24.600
goes on to show

cue0144917
01:11:24.600 --> 01:11:27.600
that from the Jewish calendar,

cue0144918
01:11:27.600 --> 01:11:29.600
you could see a mathematical

cue0144919
01:11:29.600 --> 01:11:33.600
and astronomical knowledge

cue0144920
01:11:33.600 --> 01:11:36.600
that supersede the Greek,

cue0144921
01:11:36.600 --> 01:11:38.600
that supersede the Roman,

cue0144922
01:11:38.600 --> 01:11:41.600
and supersede the current scientists

cue0144923
01:11:41.600 --> 01:11:43.600
of its time.

cue0144924
01:11:43.600 --> 01:11:44.600
Till today,

cue0144925
01:11:44.600 --> 01:11:47.600
today,

cue0144926
01:11:47.600 --> 01:11:49.600
this very year, 1996,

cue0144927
01:11:49.600 --> 01:11:52.600
there is no calendar

cue0144928
01:11:52.600 --> 01:11:55.600
which is as accurate

cue0144929
01:11:55.600 --> 01:11:57.600
as the Jewish calendar.

cue0144930
01:11:57.600 --> 01:11:58.600
When people don't understand

cue0144931
01:11:58.600 --> 01:12:01.600
why it rains in all the wrong times,

cue0144932
01:12:01.600 --> 01:12:02.600
part of the reason is because

cue0144933
01:12:02.600 --> 01:12:06.600
the Gregorian calendar that we use

cue0144934
01:12:06.600 --> 01:12:08.600
is no good.

cue0144935
01:12:08.600 --> 01:12:09.600
And many of the anomalies,

cue0144936
01:12:09.600 --> 01:12:12.600
they cannot see the cycles and this,

cue0144937
01:12:12.600 --> 01:12:16.600
because the calendar is wrong.

cue0144938
01:12:16.600 --> 01:12:20.600
Our calendar is the most perfect one.

cue0144939
01:12:20.600 --> 01:12:22.600
And shows, there are a lot of shows,

cue0144940
01:12:22.600 --> 01:12:23.600
again,

cue0144941
01:12:23.600 --> 01:12:24.600
that there is Tora,

cue0144942
01:12:24.600 --> 01:12:26.600
and there is Chahmah.

cue0144943
01:12:26.600 --> 01:12:27.600
This is what I wanted to teach you.

cue0144944
01:12:27.600 --> 01:12:29.600
Next week,

cue0144945
01:12:29.600 --> 01:12:30.600
we are going to study

cue0144946
01:12:30.600 --> 01:12:32.600
about another Italian Jew.

cue0144947
01:12:32.600 --> 01:12:34.600
Not Sephardim,

cue0144948
01:12:34.600 --> 01:12:36.600
but not ʾAshkenaz also.

cue0144949
01:12:36.600 --> 01:12:37.600
There were also, in Italy,

cue0144950
01:12:37.600 --> 01:12:39.600
there were Italian Jews,

cue0144951
01:12:39.600 --> 01:12:40.600
who were neither Sephardim

cue0144952
01:12:40.600 --> 01:12:41.600
nor ʾAshkenaz.

cue0144953
01:12:41.600 --> 01:12:42.600
I love them,

cue0144954
01:12:42.600 --> 01:12:43.600
especially,

cue0144955
01:12:43.600 --> 01:12:44.600
because when I go to the services,

cue0144956
01:12:44.600 --> 01:12:45.600
if you ever go to Israel,

cue0144957
01:12:45.600 --> 01:12:46.600
in Yerushalayim,

cue0144958
01:12:46.600 --> 01:12:47.600
there is a bit of a crisis,

cue0144959
01:12:47.600 --> 01:12:48.600
there is an Italian Jew.

cue0144960
01:12:48.600 --> 01:12:50.600
You are going to see something

cue0144961
01:12:50.600 --> 01:12:52.600
in between Sephardim and ʾAshkenaz.

cue0144962
01:12:52.600 --> 01:12:54.600
And I think,

cue0144963
01:12:54.600 --> 01:12:55.600
maybe they represent

cue0144964
01:12:55.600 --> 01:12:57.600
the old tradition

cue0144965
01:12:57.600 --> 01:12:59.600
before the Jews split

cue0144966
01:12:59.600 --> 01:13:01.600
into Sephardim and ʾAshkenaz.

cue0144967
01:13:01.600 --> 01:13:03.600
Because Sephardim and ʾAshkenaz are brothers.

cue0144968
01:13:03.600 --> 01:13:06.600
They are not brothers.

cue0144969
01:13:06.600 --> 01:13:07.600
And maybe the house

cue0144970
01:13:07.600 --> 01:13:10.600
was very similar

cue0144971
01:13:10.600 --> 01:13:12.600
to the Italian.

cue0144972
01:13:12.600 --> 01:13:13.600
Yes?

cue0144973
01:13:13.600 --> 01:13:15.600
And you feel comfortable.

cue0144974
01:13:15.600 --> 01:13:16.600
Both Sephardim and ʾAshkenaz

cue0144975
01:13:16.600 --> 01:13:17.600
feel very comfortable

cue0144976
01:13:17.600 --> 01:13:18.600
in the ʾAshkenaz

cue0144977
01:13:18.600 --> 01:13:21.600
and the Italian synagogue.

cue0144978
01:13:21.600 --> 01:13:23.600
So we are going to study Ramchal,

cue0144979
01:13:23.600 --> 01:13:24.600
Moshe Haim Nusato,

cue0144980
01:13:24.600 --> 01:13:26.600
one of the great, great minds.

cue0144981
01:13:26.600 --> 01:13:28.600
And it has to do with teshuḇa,

cue0144982
01:13:28.600 --> 01:13:29.600
teshuḇa,

cue0144983
01:13:29.600 --> 01:13:30.600
spiritual edification.

cue0144984
01:13:30.600 --> 01:13:31.600
I hope you'll come

cue0144985
01:13:31.600 --> 01:13:33.600
and you'll bring your first video.

cue0144986
01:13:33.600 --> 01:13:34.600
Thank you very much.

cue0144987
01:13:34.600 --> 01:13:35.600
And if you have questions,

cue0144988
01:13:35.600 --> 01:13:37.600
I know that the Rabbi has questions.

cue0144989
01:13:37.600 --> 01:13:38.600
So thank you very much.

cue0144990
01:13:38.600 --> 01:13:39.600
Go ahead with the questions.

cue0144991
01:13:39.600 --> 01:13:40.600
Thank you.

cue0144992
01:13:40.600 --> 01:13:41.600
Thank you very much.

cue0144993
01:13:41.600 --> 01:13:44.600
Go ahead, please.

cue0144994
01:13:44.600 --> 01:13:45.600
Rabbi, you said

cue0144995
01:13:45.600 --> 01:13:49.600
that you had a question, no?

cue0144996
01:13:49.600 --> 01:13:50.600
Controversy.

cue0144997
01:13:50.600 --> 01:13:51.600
Yes.

cue0144998
01:13:52.600 --> 01:13:56.600
No tradition, no tradition.

cue0144999
01:13:56.600 --> 01:13:57.600
No certainty.

cue0145000
01:13:57.600 --> 01:13:59.600
Accuracy, because so many

cue0145001
01:13:59.600 --> 01:14:01.600
divergent opinions.

cue0145002
01:14:01.600 --> 01:14:05.600
40, then, they were free to have,

cue0145003
01:14:05.600 --> 01:14:07.600
you know, nobody decided for them.

cue0145004
01:14:07.600 --> 01:14:08.600
But this is not historical.

cue0145005
01:14:08.600 --> 01:14:09.600
Go ahead.

cue0145006
01:14:09.600 --> 01:14:10.600
Go ahead.

cue0145007
01:14:10.600 --> 01:14:12.600
Because we find that

cue0145008
01:14:12.600 --> 01:14:15.600
who think and they give their opinions.

cue0145009
01:14:15.600 --> 01:14:17.600
You don't have to apologize for that.

cue0145010
01:14:17.600 --> 01:14:18.600
All right.

cue0145011
01:14:18.600 --> 01:14:20.600
Second, if you take a Mishna,

cue0145012
01:14:20.600 --> 01:14:21.600
which you cannot see,

cue0145013
01:14:21.600 --> 01:14:23.600
that was the authority,

cue0145014
01:14:23.600 --> 01:14:27.600
yet he called the controversies himself.

cue0145015
01:14:27.600 --> 01:14:29.600
Although he had the authority to say

cue0145016
01:14:29.600 --> 01:14:30.600
I don't want controversy,

cue0145017
01:14:30.600 --> 01:14:32.600
he did it himself.

cue0145018
01:14:32.600 --> 01:14:34.600
So what do you think that it's

cue0145019
01:14:34.600 --> 01:14:36.600
just apology, not history?

cue0145020
01:14:36.600 --> 01:14:37.600
All right.

cue0145021
01:14:37.600 --> 01:14:40.600
I want to address myself to this question.

cue0145022
01:14:40.600 --> 01:14:41.600
The truth is

cue0145023
01:14:41.600 --> 01:14:43.600
that Rabbi David Nieto points out

cue0145024
01:14:43.600 --> 01:14:45.600
that controversies emerge

cue0145025
01:14:45.600 --> 01:14:47.600
in Jewish tradition

cue0145026
01:14:47.600 --> 01:14:49.600
only after the destruction of the Temple.

cue0145027
01:14:49.600 --> 01:14:56.600
[inaudible]

cue0145028
01:14:56.600 --> 01:14:58.600
It appears, מחלוקת,

cue0145029
01:14:58.600 --> 01:15:02.600
at a critical point in Jewish history.

cue0145030
01:15:02.600 --> 01:15:04.600
And the answer to this is

cue0145031
01:15:04.600 --> 01:15:06.600
that the Jewish Sanhedrin,

cue0145032
01:15:06.600 --> 01:15:08.600
to be a Sanhedrin,

cue0145033
01:15:08.600 --> 01:15:13.600
[inaudible]

cue0145034
01:15:13.600 --> 01:15:14.600
אשר מושם.

cue0145035
01:15:14.600 --> 01:15:16.600
The Sanhedrin has to be part

cue0145036
01:15:16.600 --> 01:15:18.600
of the Bet HaMikdash.

cue0145037
01:15:18.600 --> 01:15:20.600
And if the Sanhedrin is not part

cue0145038
01:15:20.600 --> 01:15:22.600
of the Bet HaMikdash,

cue0145039
01:15:22.600 --> 01:15:24.600
it is not a Sanhedrin.

cue0145040
01:15:24.600 --> 01:15:25.600
Therefore,

cue0145041
01:15:25.600 --> 01:15:27.600
with the destruction of the Bet HaMikdash

cue0145042
01:15:27.600 --> 01:15:29.600
and even before that,

cue0145043
01:15:29.600 --> 01:15:31.600
we can no longer

cue0145044
01:15:31.600 --> 01:15:34.600
apply capital punishment

cue0145045
01:15:34.600 --> 01:15:37.600
because we had no Sanhedrin.

cue0145046
01:15:37.600 --> 01:15:39.600
Now,

cue0145047
01:15:39.600 --> 01:15:40.600
the Ben ha-Qadosh,

cue0145048
01:15:40.600 --> 01:15:42.600
he had a court.

cue0145049
01:15:42.600 --> 01:15:45.600
But his court was not a Sanhedrin

cue0145050
01:15:45.600 --> 01:15:47.600
because the Temple was destroyed

cue0145051
01:15:48.600 --> 01:15:50.600
and no matter how much

cue0145052
01:15:50.600 --> 01:15:52.600
people liked him and loved him,

cue0145053
01:15:52.600 --> 01:15:56.600
he was not a Sanhedrin.

cue0145054
01:15:56.600 --> 01:15:57.600
And therefore,

cue0145055
01:15:57.600 --> 01:15:59.600
the Ben ha-Qadosh by law,

cue0145056
01:15:59.600 --> 01:16:01.600
from a point of view of law,

cue0145057
01:16:01.600 --> 01:16:04.600
he cannot settle

cue0145058
01:16:04.600 --> 01:16:06.600
the controversy once and for all

cue0145059
01:16:06.600 --> 01:16:08.600
because he is only

cue0145060
01:16:08.600 --> 01:16:10.600
a court

cue0145061
01:16:10.600 --> 01:16:13.600
but is not the Supreme Court of Israel.

cue0145062
01:16:13.600 --> 01:16:14.600
Supreme Court of Israel,

cue0145063
01:16:14.600 --> 01:16:16.600
it has to be part

cue0145064
01:16:16.600 --> 01:16:17.600
of the Bet HaMikdash.

cue0145065
01:16:17.600 --> 01:16:18.600
And that's why,

cue0145066
01:16:18.600 --> 01:16:19.600
yes,

cue0145067
01:16:19.600 --> 01:16:21.600
we always said,

cue0145068
01:16:23.600 --> 01:16:25.600
let the building of the Bet HaMikdash be rebuilt soon.

cue0145069
01:16:25.600 --> 01:16:26.600
Why?

cue0145070
01:16:26.600 --> 01:16:28.600
Because unless,

cue0145071
01:16:28.600 --> 01:16:30.600
from the point of view of Jewish thinking,

cue0145072
01:16:30.600 --> 01:16:33.600
unless we have a Bet HaMikdash,

cue0145073
01:16:33.600 --> 01:16:36.600
we cannot have a Supreme Court.

cue0145074
01:16:36.600 --> 01:16:38.600
So that's more or less the answer.

cue0145075
01:16:38.600 --> 01:16:39.600
Maybe there is another person

cue0145076
01:16:39.600 --> 01:16:40.600
that has another question

cue0145077
01:16:40.600 --> 01:16:41.600
that would like to say,

cue0145078
01:16:41.600 --> 01:16:42.600
if not,

cue0145079
01:16:42.600 --> 01:16:43.600
I'm going to say Kaddish,

cue0145080
01:16:43.600 --> 01:16:45.600
Rabbi Jahanian please say,

cue0145081
01:16:45.600 --> 01:16:47.600
because it's a big covenant between the two of us,

cue0145082
01:16:47.600 --> 01:16:51.600
and after the covenant realm

cue0145083
01:16:51.600 --> 01:16:53.600
that is first,

cue0145084
01:16:53.600 --> 01:16:55.600
second,

cue0145085
01:16:55.600 --> 01:16:58.600
and so on.
